      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town covers roughly 0.2 square miles, sitting 11 miles southwest of Frostburg and 6 miles northeast of Westernport in a coal‑mining region.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
